{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":83097,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793434385814,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tPxCpfUs38Y74XvHRZvUot8BkTk.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1894536","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Emma and the children have finally escaped the House and now head to the place indicated on the pen Norman gave them. But on their way, a large, wild demon attacks the group…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1QF9bF7R8KXModXDa1zZOvm5bt3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1QF9bF7R8KXModXDa1zZOvm5bt3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83097/season/2/episode/1"},{"id":"2620978","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The children’s saviors turn out to be demons named Mujika and Sonju. The pair claims that their religion forbids them from eating humans. Emma and Ray visit Sonju while the others are sleeping in order to find out what happened to humans thirty years ago.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4zqSlw8mdIjsibMYpNHnvV4Hysi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4zqSlw8mdIjsibMYpNHnvV4Hysi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83097/season/2/episode/2"},{"id":"2647658","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Emma and the group learn the necessary skills to survive in this world from Mujika and Sonju. Back on their own, the children traverse a wasteland in search of a place called “B06-32.”","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1EgiONNX9CgO6i4DjyeVBvsvT9v.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1EgiONNX9CgO6i4DjyeVBvsvT9v.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83097/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"2647659","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Without warning, the shelter’s phone begins to ring, echoing through the halls. Emma hesitantly answers and finds that it is William Minerva. Meanwhile, in an underground room at the farm headquarters, a deal is made…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5.1,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uJGPqoNJjSn4zBeaMoLcOpiVe5P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uJGPqoNJjSn4zBeaMoLcOpiVe5P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83097/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"2647669","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Emma and the other escapees manage to survive the attack on the shelter. Now they have settled in an abandoned temple a short ways from a demon town. Unlike the shelter and Grace Field House, here there is a limited supply of food, and they are barely surviving.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":4.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4wkH3s9d7YFvnjvQ24rS1pj4oUk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4wkH3s9d7YFvnjvQ24rS1pj4oUk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83097/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"2647670","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Norman, thought to have been shipped, stands before Emma and Ray. It is a reunion they never dreamed of, and they embrace tearfully. Norman reveals his plan to create the future Emma wants, where the children can live happily.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":4.9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8G5sLhWRKdJweuMw3RRFZOoDQCR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8G5sLhWRKdJweuMw3RRFZOoDQCR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83097/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"2647672","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Though Emma pleads with him, explaining she has no wish to eradicate the demons, Norman is set in his decision and deaf to her arguments. To resolve their dispute, Emma proposes a deal.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":4.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lbVYNXOtQSVU69ee7qbHWJ1f7b8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lbVYNXOtQSVU69ee7qbHWJ1f7b8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/83097/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"2696402","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Norman, seized by a terrible fit of coughing, spits up blood. He lied about not being experimented on when he was at Lambda. With the little time he has left, Norman manages to reunite with Emma and hopes to create a world where she and the children can live in peace.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oHQXhKsZMF7uDINKFHdn53ToJv0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"htt